-- EXPECT-ERROR: cannot verify precondition `_ > 0` on `need_pos`
-- Element refinements, multi-parameter domain facts (2026-10-18, design
-- specs/2026-10-18-element-flow-followups-design.md phase 1), the boundary:
-- `fold_left`'s `acc : b` has a bare source (the initial value) and a
-- codomain source (the callback's result), so it is not an element-only
-- variable and gets NO domain fact, although `x` does.  Assuming the demand
-- on `acc` is an accumulator invariant (specs/2026-10-18-fold-accumulator-
-- invariants-design.md), not a domain fact.  `need_pos(acc)` is a skip, and
-- `cap verified` makes it this error.  Accept twin: accept/t340.
mod FoldAccumulatorNoFact do
  cap verified
  fn need_pos(k : {Int | _ > 0}) : Int do k end
  fn folded(xs : List({Int | _ > 0})) : Int do
    List.fold_left(xs, 1, fn (acc, x) -> need_pos(acc) + x)
  end
end
